<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-ICC TROPHY FIRST DAY MATCH SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ICC TROPHY FIRST DAY MATCH SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of the 50-overs matches in the 22-nation International Cricket Council Trophy (ICC) on Monday:</p>
<p>Netherlands beat East and Central Africa by eight wickets</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>East and Central Africa 26 all out (15 overs)</p>
<p>Netherlands 27/2 (5.2 overs)</p>
</text>
